            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Michelle"
            },
            "reviewBody": "No more store bought! Great recipe! I followed the ingredients but omitted the lemon &amp; onion, Added a Tablespoon of Ketchup &amp; Onion Powder, 2 Tablespoons of Dill Weed, 2 Tablespoons of Parsley Flakes &amp; did a Cup &amp; a Half of Miracle Whip(we don't like real mayo), along with a little Black Pepper. Made a small batch, enough for 4 people for 2 days.",
            "datePublished": "2025-04-23T21:26:50.476Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Steve Plank"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I substituted 1/2 teaspoon of onion powder for the minced onion, and it was fine. I added the full 2 tablespoons of lemon juice, but probably will cut that to 1 tablespoon next time.",
            "datePublished": "2025-03-15T22:34:00.639Z"
