            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LoriG"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used zest and lemon juice - minced dried onion - will use grated onion next time- dill weed and sweet relish. I find mayo sweet enough so next time I’m going to try with finely diced dill pickle. We like our sauce more on the tart side. Also added minced garlic . Only made half batch as there are only 2 of us and this will be more than enough",
